<!--
  Every indexable page on the site, and nothing else. /delete-data/ and /404.html
  are noindex and stay out.

  No <lastmod>, <changefreq> or <priority>. Google ignores the last two outright,
  and there is no build step here to keep the first one honest, so a hand-written
  date would go stale the first time a page changed without anyone remembering to
  come back and edit it. A stale lastmod is read as an unreliable signal and is
  worse than none. The one rule this file has: add a <url> when you add a page.
-->
